          "countedNote": null,
          "key": "Neutral oil"
        }
      ],
      "body": "Oil a bowl, put the dough in and cover with a towel. Rise somewhere warm until doubled, ≈1 h."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Deflate with 3 fingers and turn out onto a lightly floured surface. Knead a couple of minutes. Divide into 15 pieces (≈68 g each)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Shape into tight balls by pulling the edges underneath. Butter the baking dish, set the balls in it, cover and rise ≈30 min. Preheat oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">350 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(177 °C)</span></span>."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [
